=== components declared per seL4 fixture (the `components = [...]` block only) ===

Grant names are excluded: they live in a separate `grants` block and are
edges rather than components. B11 is about which *components* a graph
declares, so counting grants would overstate every fixture.

--- sel4-channel.zti: 2 components
  init
  console

--- sel4-crossing.zti: 2 components
  init
  crossing-peer

--- sel4-loan.zti: 3 components
  init
  sample-receiver
  console

--- sel4-sample.zti: 3 components
  init
  sample-lender
  sample-receiver

--- sel4-spawn.zti: 3 components
  init
  console
  sysinfo

--- sel4-stream.zti: 7 components
  init
  fabric-service
  fabric-publisher
  fabric-publisher-b
  fabric-subscriber
  fabric-subscriber-b
  fabric-intruder

--- sel4-supervision.zti: 3 components
  init
  supervision-child
  sysinfo

--- sel4.zti: 5 components
  init
  console
  spawn-service
  sysinfo
  echo-agent

